{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "この半年とちょっとで、今しかできないことの連続だということがすごくよく分かりました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これがもう二度と来ない夏だと分かりながら、いつも通りにしょうもないことが一番面白くて楽しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "当たり前が変わるスピードがあまりにも早く感じてしまうけれど、大切な別れに全力で向き合ってくださるミーツチームの方々のおかげで、私はしっかりと今を見ることができているのだと思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日のサクラミーツ公開収録で、第4回サクラミーツイベントのキービジュアルが公開されました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ステージから直接皆さんの反応を見られてすごく嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同時に、写真を見て切なくなってしまった方の表情がすごく心に残っています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな方にこそ絶対に来ていただきたいイベントです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たのしいイベントにします　☺️\nよかったら、会いに来てくださると嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "キービジュアル撮影の時のオフショットー☺︎"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobMvcewJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob8PAioA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobpogI5T.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobXHH1lz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob1MUJc2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobeaIKUS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobfasWeJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最強の　ももみんさん\n公開収録ありがとう　♡\nももみんファンの皆様来週のミーツ楽しみにしててね　^_^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日からツアー広島！　わくわく"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob9Viexp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんにいいことひとつありますように"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆーづより"}], "source": "official"}